OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,FThe Football Association (FA) has said
OL,7,Fit is "deeply concerned about the lack
OL,8,Fof process and governance" regarding
OL,9,FFifa's plans to establish a private
OL,10,Fcompany to run its competitions.
OL,12,FThe proposed company, Fifa Forward
OL,13,FEnterprise (FFE), would oversee the
OL,14,Fsale of the governing body's
OL,15,Fcommercial rights and the operational
OL,16,Fdelivery of its tournaments.
OL,26,@oD@GOUpD@ZO]
