OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785341897
OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,FFifa said Thrive Eternal, a company
OL,7,Festablished in April with links to the
OL,8,Fextended family of US President Donald
OL,9,FTrump, would lead the proposed
OL,10,Finvestor group for FFE.
OL,12,FIts plans prompted backlash from
OL,13,FEuropean football's governing body,
OL,14,FUefa, which insisted the World Cup is
OL,15,Fnot an "asset to trade" and that the
OL,16,FConfederation may boycott the
OL,17,Ftournament.
OL,26,@wD@HOUwD@WO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785341897
OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,F"We were completely unaware of this
OL,7,Fproposal and have no substantive
OL,8,Fdetails, including what the
OL,9,Fproposition actually is, and what
OL,10,Fconditions are attached," the FA said
OL,11,Fin a statement on Wednesday.
OL,13,F"Based on the limited information, we
OL,14,Fare deeply concerned about the lack of
OL,15,Fprocess and governance to get to this
OL,16,Fpoint, and the apparent substance and
OL,17,Fprinciples involved.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@YO]uD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785341897
OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,F"When the proposal is shared in the
OL,7,Ffull and transparent way now promised
OL,8,Fby FIFA, we will make our views clear,
OL,9,Fand comment further."
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham also
OL,12,Fchimed in, saying on Tuesday that the
OL,13,FWorld Cup "was never anyone's to sell".
OL,15,FWriting on social media, he said:
OL,16,F"World Cup is not a product".
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@UO]uD@KOUuD@fO]xD@AOUxD@\O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785341897
OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,F"Let me say this very directly.
OL,8,F"Football does not belong to
OL,9,Finvestors. It belongs to the people
OL,10,Fwho fill the stands and who stand on
OL,11,Fthe touchline week in, week out, rain
OL,12,For shine.
OL,14,F"The World Cup is not a product. It is
OL,15,Fthe greatest competition in world
OL,16,Fsport, and it was never anyone's to
OL,17,Fsell. Dress the deal up however you
OL,18,Flike. Once you have sold a piece of
OL,19,Fit, you have sold out.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1785341897
OL,3,CFA 'deeply concerned' over Fifa's
OL,4,CWorld Cup private investment plan
OL,6,F"Football belongs to the fans. It
OL,7,Falways has, and it always will."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@`O]
